The language files in mixins/universalgraves/data/lang/ and the icon in
mixins/universalgraves/data/icon.png come from the original mod
(src/main/resources/data/universal_graves/lang/, assets/logo.png). The skin
textures of the menu heads (defaults.rs) are the original's (IconItem.Texture).
The config's defaults (defaults.rs) follow the original's Config class.

This port, by DispatchedToHeaven, rewrites Universal Graves' Java code in Rust
for Horizon's native mod API. It uses no code from the original's libraries
(Polymer, sgui, Placeholder API, Predicate API, Common Protection API): the
grave model, the menus and the text format are written for this port.

